y":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n### Reproducible in:\nv4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\n\n### Not reproducible in:\nv4.7.2.rc1.official [36a04fe52]\nv4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Asset Store, click on the button: Plugins...\n>  ERROR: scene/gui/tab_container.cpp:758 - Condition \"p_child->get_parent() != this\" is true. Returning: -1\n>  ERROR: Cannot deselect tabs, deselection is not enabled.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create a new project\n- open the Asset Store\n- in the top right corner click on the button: Plugins...\n\n### Issue\nThe project settings window opens, but it shows the General tab instead of the Addons tab.\nThe output panel shows:\n>  ERROR: scene/gui/tab_container.cpp:758 - Condition \"p_child->get_parent() != this\" is true. Returning: -1\n>  ERROR: Cannot deselect tabs, deselection is not enabled.\n\n### Expected\nOpen the project settings window, and show the Addons tab's Plugins subtab.\n\n### Possible cause\nUI difference in the Project Settings window:\n#### Error: v4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\nA main tab: Addons\nwith two subtabs:\nPlugins\nGDExtension\n\n<img width=\"727\" height=\"215\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd182032-b2a6-4618-b5ca-2416341fe8e7\" />\n\n#### No Error: v4.7.2.rc1.official [36a04fe52] and v4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\nTwo main tabs:\nPlugins\nGDExtension\n\n<img width=\"727\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/710fce0f-6d09-43cf-9755-fc672f580d10\" />\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ND